B.agj=new A.a4("About UniBridge","UniBridge helps students in Algeria find each other to exchange money, buy and sell items, and keep their student information in one place. UniBridge never holds, sends or receives money. Every exchange happens directly between the two users, outside the app.")
B.afP=new A.a4("Your account",'You sign up with your email and a password (or Google). You must give true information and keep your password secret. One person, one account. You can delete your account at any time (see "Deleting your account" in the privacy policy).')
B.agi=new A.a4("Exchanges between users","You are fully responsible for every exchange you make, and for respecting the laws of Algeria, including the rules on foreign currency. UniBridge is not a party to any exchange and cannot promise that the other user will keep their word. Suggested matches are only suggestions: a match happens only when both people accept. Both users must confirm in the app before an exchange counts as completed. If something goes wrong, open a dispute in the chat.")
B.afU=new A.a4("Marketplace","Only list items you own and are allowed to sell. Forbidden: illegal items, weapons, drugs, stolen goods, fake documents, and anything that breaks the law.")
B.afH=new A.a4("Behaviour","No scams, harassment, insults, spam, fake profiles or sharing other people's private information. You can report and block any user. We may hide content or close accounts that break these rules.")
B.afw=new A.a4("Emergency alerts","The Educational Attach\xe9 may send urgent alerts to every user. Please read them carefully. They do not replace the official channels of the embassy or the Algerian authorities.")
B.ag1=new A.a4("No warranty",'The app is provided "as is". Exchange rates shown in the app are for information only. As far as the law allows, UniBridge is not liable for losses caused by exchanges or deals between users.')
B.afE=new A.a4("Changes","We may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version. If you keep using the app, you accept the new terms.")
B.agh=new A.a4("Contact","Questions: mudaranokutenda@gmail.com")
B.a5m=s([B.agj,B.afP,B.agi,B.afU,B.afH,B.afw,B.ag1,B.afE,B.agh],t.Wy)
