B.afV=new A.a4("What we collect","\u2022 Account: your name and email.\n\u2022 Profile: photo, wilaya, city or area, phone number.\n\u2022 Student space (you fill it in): student record (name, gender, program, level, years, wilaya, inscription number, phone), bank account number, passport number, results (PDF), date of entry into Algeria, passport scan when you ask for an attestation de bourse, appointment requests.\n\u2022 Verification (optional): a photo of your student card.\n\u2022 Activity: requests, chats (text and photos), listings, ratings, reports and blocks.\n\u2022 Device: a notification token, so we can send you notifications.")
B.agd=new A.a4("Who can see what","\u2022 Every user: your name, profile photo, wilaya, city or area, verification badge, rating, number of completed exchanges and member-since date.\n\u2022 Your phone number: you, the Educational Attach\xe9 and the Governor of your wilaya. Never other students.\n\u2022 Your student record and results: you, the Educational Attach\xe9 and the Governor of your wilaya.\n\u2022 Your bank account number: you, the Educational Attach\xe9 and the Governor of your wilaya.\n\u2022 Your passport number, passport scan and attestations: you and the Educational Attach\xe9 only. Never a Governor.\n\u2022 Your appointments: you and the Educational Attach\xe9.\n\u2022 Your student card (verification): you and the UniBridge team.\n\u2022 Your chats: only the two people in the chat.\n\u2022 Your email: never shown to other users.\nThe app administrator can technically access the stored data in order to run the app. Every time the Educational Attach\xe9 or a Governor opens your results, bank account, passport number or passport scan, it is recorded in an access log that cannot be changed.")
B.ag3=new A.a4("Who is who","The Educational Attach\xe9 of Zimbabwe works in the embassy office. A Governor is the student representative of one wilaya. UniBridge itself is not an embassy app.")
B.afG=new A.a4("Why we use it","To run the app: matching, chat, marketplace, notifications, student records, attestations, appointments, emergency alerts, and trust and safety (verification, reports, disputes).")
B.afC=new A.a4("Not sold, not shared","We do not sell your data and we do not show ads. We do not share it with anyone outside the people listed above. The data is stored by the services that run the app: Supabase (database, login, files) and Google Firebase (notifications); Google sign-in is handled by Google. These services may store data outside Algeria. We protect the data with access rules in the database, but no system can be called completely safe.")
B.afW=new A.a4("How long we keep it","\u2022 Chats (messages and photos) are deleted 30 days after the request is completed or cancelled. Chats of a request under dispute are kept until the dispute is solved. The request itself and the ratings stay, because ratings depend on them.\n\u2022 Your passport scan is deleted after your attestation is issued.\n\u2022 Everything else is kept until you delete your account.")
B.afu=new A.a4("Deleting your account",'Profile tab \u2192 Delete my account \u2192 type DELETE. This deletes your profile, phone number, student record, bank account and passport numbers, results, passport scans, attestations, appointments, photos (also those you sent in chats), listings, open requests and notifications. Finished exchanges, chat text messages and ratings stay for the other person, shown as "UniBridge user". The access log keeps its records for safety. You cannot delete your account while an exchange is in progress. Messages you sent stay visible to the other person until the chat is deleted automatically, 30 days after the request ends. A security log of who opened sensitive documents is kept even after an account is deleted.')
B.afs=new A.a4("Your rights","You can see and change your information in the app, delete your account in the app, and write to us to ask for a copy of your data or to correct it (Algerian law 18-07 on personal data).")
B.agr=new A.a4("Contact","Privacy questions: mudaranokutenda@gmail.com")
B.a6H=s([B.afV,B.agd,B.ag3,B.afG,B.afC,B.afW,B.afu,B.afs,B.agr],t.Wy)
